==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Wishiwashi}} in its {{form|Wishiwashi|Solo Form}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Dragon Majesty|Wishiwashi|31}} from the {{TCG|Dragon Majesty}} expansion.
*'''Call for Family''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Jungle|Nidoran♀|57}} and {{TCG ID|Jungle|Bellsprout|49}}, both from the {{TCG|Jungle}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

